# The Master of Lake-town {1}{B}{B}: "Whenever a player loses life, that player mills that many cards." Mox Jet and two Mox Pearls
# make three mana but one {B}, so it is refused (the {B}{B} is pinned); a second Mox Jet pays it exactly with a Pearl. Bot1's
# Lightning Bolt at Bot2 makes Bot2 lose 3 and mill its top three cards (Crimson Kobolds, Ornithopter, Memnite); Bot2's Bolt at Bot1
# makes Bot1 - the Master's own controller - lose 3 and mill its own top three (Memnite, Ornithopter, Mox Emerald). Whoever lost
# the life mills, not the Master's controller.

